#!/usr/bin/env xdg-open
[Desktop Entry]
Name=Install DeckyHub
Name[uk]=Встановити DeckyHub
Name[ru]=Установить DeckyHub
Name[es]=Instalar DeckyHub
Name[de]=DeckyHub installieren
Name[fr]=Installer DeckyHub
Name[pt_BR]=Instalar o DeckyHub
Name[pt]=Instalar o DeckyHub
Name[it]=Installa DeckyHub
Name[pl]=Zainstaluj DeckyHub
Name[tr]=DeckyHub'ı yükle
Name[nl]=DeckyHub installeren
Name[cs]=Nainstalovat DeckyHub
Name[ja]=DeckyHub をインストール
Name[ko]=DeckyHub 설치
Name[zh_CN]=安装 DeckyHub
Name[zh_TW]=安裝 DeckyHub
Comment=Installs DeckyHub (and Decky Loader if needed) on this device
Comment[uk]=Встановлює DeckyHub (і Decky Loader, якщо потрібно) на цей пристрій
Comment[ru]=Устанавливает DeckyHub (и Decky Loader, если нужно) на это устройство
Comment[es]=Instala DeckyHub (y Decky Loader si hace falta) en este dispositivo
Comment[de]=Installiert DeckyHub (und bei Bedarf Decky Loader) auf diesem Gerät
Comment[fr]=Installe DeckyHub (et Decky Loader si nécessaire) sur cet appareil
Comment[pt_BR]=Instala o DeckyHub (e o Decky Loader, se necessário) neste dispositivo
Comment[pt]=Instala o DeckyHub (e o Decky Loader, se necessário) neste dispositivo
Comment[it]=Installa DeckyHub (e Decky Loader se serve) su questo dispositivo
Comment[pl]=Instaluje DeckyHub (i w razie potrzeby Decky Loader) na tym urządzeniu
Comment[tr]=DeckyHub'ı (ve gerekirse Decky Loader'ı) bu cihaza yükler
Comment[nl]=Installeert DeckyHub (en zo nodig Decky Loader) op dit apparaat
Comment[cs]=Nainstaluje DeckyHub (a v případě potřeby Decky Loader) na toto zařízení
Comment[ja]=このデバイスに DeckyHub (必要なら Decky Loader も) をインストールします
Comment[ko]=이 기기에 DeckyHub(필요하면 Decky Loader도)를 설치합니다
Comment[zh_CN]=在这台设备上安装 DeckyHub（如有需要还会安装 Decky Loader）
Comment[zh_TW]=在這台裝置上安裝 DeckyHub（如有需要也會安裝 Decky Loader）
Exec=sh -c 'work=$(mktemp -d) || exit 1; if command -v zenity >/dev/null 2>&1; then (curl -fsSL --connect-timeout 60 -o "$work/install.sh" https://github.com/mazillka/deckyhub-plugin/releases/download/@TAG@/install-deckyhub.sh && touch "$work/downloaded"; echo 100) | zenity --progress --pulsate --auto-close --no-cancel --title="DeckyHub Installer" --text="Getting the installer ready…" 2>/dev/null; else curl -fsSL --connect-timeout 60 -o "$work/install.sh" https://github.com/mazillka/deckyhub-plugin/releases/download/@TAG@/install-deckyhub.sh && touch "$work/downloaded"; fi; if test -f "$work/downloaded"; then bash "$work/install.sh"; else zenity --error --title="DeckyHub Installer" --text="Could not get the installer. Check that your device is connected to Wi-Fi, then try again." 2>/dev/null || echo "Could not get the installer." >&2; fi; rm -rf "$work"'
Icon=steamdeck-gaming-return
Terminal=false
Type=Application
StartupNotify=false
Categories=System;
